---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { learningPaths, featuredRepositories } from '../../data/learning';
---
<Base title="技术学习路线" description="五个领域的工程学习路线与八个精选开源学习项目">
  <div class="container listing-page">
    <div class="page-eyebrow">CURRICULUM / ENGINEERING ROADMAP</div>
    <h1>技术学习路线<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
    <p class="page-lead">不堆砌课程。从可运行的最小实现开始，逐步补齐原理、故障处理、测试和可复现的成果。覆盖 5 个领域，精选 GitHub 项目总计 8 个。</p>
    <div class="roadmap-grid">{learningPaths.map((path,i)=><a href={`/learning/${path.slug}/`} class="roadmap-card">
      <div class="roadmap-top"><span>TRACK / {String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span>↗</span></div><div class="roadmap-subtitle">{path.subtitle}</div>
      <h2>{path.title}</h2><p>{path.summary}</p><div class="roadmap-footer"><span>{path.stages.length} 个阶段</span><span>{path.repositories.length} 个 GitHub 项目</span></div>
    </a>)}</div>
    <div class="section-heading resources-title"><div><div class="section-kicker">CURATED / 8 REPOSITORIES</div><h2>开源学习项目<span class="accent">.</span></h2><p>仅收录可确认的真实仓库，按学习价值而不是 Star 排名。</p></div></div>
    <div class="resource-grid">{featuredRepositories.map((repo,i)=><a href={repo.url} class="resource-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <div class="resource-top"><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / GITHUB</span><span class="resource-link">↗</span></div>
      <h3>{repo.name}</h3><div class="resource-domain">{repo.domain} · {repo.level}</div>
      <p>{repo.purpose}</p><div class="resource-task"><strong>实操：</strong>{repo.task}</div>
    </a>)}</div>
    <p class="resource-disclaimer">这些链接是独立学习资源，既不代表本网站参与维护，也不意味着已复现其全部示例。使用时请阅读各仓库 README 与 License，并记录你所研究的 Commit。</p>
  </div>
</Base>